{"4069760": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "VR AIM", "steam_appid": 4069760, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >VR AIM – The Aim Trainer Built for VR Shooters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stop practicing on flat-screen trainers that don't transfer. VR AIM is designed from the ground up for VR mechanics, helping you build muscle memory that actually matters in-game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069760/extras/13478d86a6160995ae1f666223c59a28.poster.avif?t=1785742235\" width=1170 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069760/extras/13478d86a6160995ae1f666223c59a28.webm?t=1785742235\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069760/extras/13478d86a6160995ae1f666223c59a28.mp4?t=1785742235\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔥 <strong>Drills That Matter</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flicks, tracking, precision, speed. Multiple scenario types designed to target your weak spots and sharpen your strengths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069760/extras/7750da302b576d1a740192d487bb2ad1.poster.avif?t=1785742235\" width=1170 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069760/extras/7750da302b576d1a740192d487bb2ad1.webm?t=1785742235\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069760/extras/7750da302b576d1a740192d487bb2ad1.mp4?t=1785742235\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎯 <strong>Your Settings, Your Way</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Match your training to your game. Adjust hand positioning, gun angles, and V-stock settings to feel exactly like VAIL, Pavlov, Breachers, or Onward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069760/extras/13924560b375d2ce44c52389173f5326.poster.avif?t=1785742235\" width=1170 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069760/extras/13924560b375d2ce44c52389173f5326.webm?t=1785742235\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069760/extras/13924560b375d2ce44c52389173f5326.mp4?t=1785742235\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >👥 <strong>Community Presets</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One-click setups from the community. Instantly load settings that match your favorite shooter — no guesswork needed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069760/extras/c6404772571b7806825fc59e81e738a6.avif?t=1785742235\" width=1280 height=420 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏆 <strong>Compete &amp; Climb</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leaderboards for every scenario. See how you stack up and push yourself to beat the best.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >VR AIM – The Aim Trainer Built for VR Shooters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stop practicing on flat-screen trainers that don't transfer. VR AIM is designed from the ground up for VR mechanics, helping you build muscle memory that actually matters in-game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069760/extras/13478d86a6160995ae1f666223c59a28.poster.avif?t=1785742235\" width=1170 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069760/extras/13478d86a6160995ae1f666223c59a28.webm?t=1785742235\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069760/extras/13478d86a6160995ae1f666223c59a28.mp4?t=1785742235\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔥 <strong>Drills That Matter</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flicks, tracking, precision, speed. Multiple scenario types designed to target your weak spots and sharpen your strengths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069760/extras/7750da302b576d1a740192d487bb2ad1.poster.avif?t=1785742235\" width=1170 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069760/extras/7750da302b576d1a740192d487bb2ad1.webm?t=1785742235\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069760/extras/7750da302b576d1a740192d487bb2ad1.mp4?t=1785742235\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎯 <strong>Your Settings, Your Way</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Match your training to your game. Adjust hand positioning, gun angles, and V-stock settings to feel exactly like VAIL, Pavlov, Breachers, or Onward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069760/extras/13924560b375d2ce44c52389173f5326.poster.avif?t=1785742235\" width=1170 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069760/extras/13924560b375d2ce44c52389173f5326.webm?t=1785742235\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069760/extras/13924560b375d2ce44c52389173f5326.mp4?t=1785742235\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >👥 <strong>Community Presets</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One-click setups from the community. Instantly load settings that match your favorite shooter — no guesswork needed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069760/extras/c6404772571b7806825fc59e81e738a6.avif?t=1785742235\" width=1280 height=420 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏆 <strong>Compete &amp; Climb</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leaderboards for every scenario. See how you stack up and push yourself to beat the best.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>", "short_description": "VR AIM is a VR-first aim training platform built for players who take VR shooters seriously. Unlike traditional or flat-screen-inspired aim trainers, VR AIM focuses on real techniques, real recoil, and real hardware setups. The skills you train actually transfer into gameplay.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069760/e013acd471657780c2219de92a952275f1eae71b/header.jpg?t=1785742235", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069760/547b023cfd461195368d1578b72f902f65d16ab4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1785742235", 